# expect: 2000000000
# expect: 3000000000
# expect: 4000000000
# expect: ok
# `each` monomorphization (TYPED_CLOSURES_DESIGN.md Phase A): `for $stream [\ body]`
# is the HOF callback form (OP_EACH). Over a wide i64 stream the inline callback
# is typed to read $it wide, so the pull hands the element over wide with no
# box-for-call, and wide arithmetic in the body works on it directly. Values
# past INT32_MAX guard against tag confusion at the callback boundary.
proc main {} {
  for [transform [range 1 4] [\ $* $it 1000000000]] [\ print [+ $it 1000000000]]
  print "ok"                        # prints 2e9, 3e9, 4e9
}
main
